### Get User Group Report

GET https://{{server}}/interop/rest/security/v2/report/usergroupreport
Authorization: {{creds}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Available Roles

GET https://{{server}}/interop/rest/security/v2/role/getavailableroles
Authorization: {{creds}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

